Fork provenance
---------------
MyPaiOS is a fork of Odysseus (Copyright (c) 2025 Odysseus Contributors).

- Forked at the MIT-licensed snapshot, upstream commit 8354948 (2026-06-05).
- Upstream Odysseus relicensed to AGPL-3.0-or-later on 2026-06-09,
  AFTER the fork point.
- No post-fork upstream code is included in MyPaiOS. Everything inherited
  from Odysseus in this repository comes from the MIT snapshot and remains
  under the MIT License (see LICENSE).
- MOST OF THIS CODEBASE IS ODYSSEUS'S WORK: 877 of 1030 files are inherited
  (626 of them byte-identical to upstream), only 31 of 929 commits are
  post-fork, and roughly 6% of the source lines are MyPaiOS's. See
  ACKNOWLEDGMENTS.md for the measured breakdown and for what MyPaiOS added.
- The demo screenshots and screen recordings in docs/ were authored by the
  Odysseus contributors and arrived with the MIT snapshot (upstream commit
  e5c99a5); docs/paios.jpg is upstream's docs/odysseus.jpg, renamed. They
